Package: ismini
Version: 9.0.9
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tasos Delotas <tasosdelotas@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tasosdelotas/ismini-linux
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: ismini — your personal AI agent, powered locally on your PC
 ismini is a small, friendly AI assistant that runs on your computer and uses
 a local AI model in LM Studio by default. It chats with you in your browser
 and can read/write files, run shell commands (with an optional sudo toggle),
 search the web, remember facts across sessions, understand images, and hold
 continuous voice conversations — all locally, with no cloud account required.
 .
 This package installs the app to ~/ismini and a launcher in your desktop
 menu. All you need is LM Studio (https://lmstudio.ai) with a model loaded.
